<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Ismail's Calisthenics Bible</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700;800;900&family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;900&display=swap');
  :root {
    --bg: #1a1a2e;
    --bg-card: #16213e;
    --bg-hover: #1a1a3e;
    --text: #e0e0e0;
    --text-light: #fff;
    --text-muted: #888;
    --text-dim: #666;
    --text-body: #b0b0b0;
    --border: #1a1a4e;
    --border-light: #333;
    --accent: #e94560;
    --accent2: #4ecca3;
    --accent3: #5352ed;
    --nav-bg: rgba(15,12,41,0.95);
    --cover-bg: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0c29, #302b63, #24243e);
  }
  [data-theme="light"] {
    --bg: #f0f2f5;
    --bg-card: #ffffff;
    --bg-hover: #f5f6f8;
    --text: #222;
    --text-light: #111;
    --text-muted: #888;
    --text-dim: #aaa;
    --text-body: #555;
    --border: #ddd;
    --border-light: #ccc;
    --accent: #d63851;
    --accent2: #3dbb92;
    --accent3: #4443d6;
    --nav-bg: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
    --cover-bg: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2, #f093fb);
  }
  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Inter', Georgia, serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 16px;
    transition: background 0.3s;
  }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width:8px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background:var(--bg); }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background:var(--text-dim); border-radius:4px; }
  .page-content { display:none; }
  .page-content.active { display:block; animation: fadeIn .35s ease; }
  @keyframes fadeIn { from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)} to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)} }
  .navbar {
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:100;
    background:var(--nav-bg); backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:0 20px; height:56px;
  }
  .navbar .brand { font-weight:800; font-size:14px; color:var(--accent); letter-spacing:1px; }
  .nav-links { display:flex; gap:4px; align-items:center; }
  .nav-links a {
    color:var(--text-muted); padding:8px 16px; border-radius:8px;
    cursor:pointer; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; transition:all .2s;
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; text-decoration:none;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover { color:var(--text-light); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
  .nav-links a.active { color:var(--accent); background:rgba(233,69,96,0.15); }
  .theme-btn {
    background:none; border:1px solid var(--border-light);
    color:var(--text-muted); width:36px; height:36px;
    border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer; font-size:16px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    transition:all .3s; margin-left:8px;
  }
  .theme-btn:hover { border-color:var(--accent); color:var(--accent); transform:rotate(30deg); }
  .cover {
    min-height:100vh; background:var(--cover-bg);
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; align-items:center;
    text-align:center; padding:40px 20px;
    border-bottom:6px solid var(--accent); position:relative; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .cover::before {
    content:''; position:absolute; top:-50%; left:-50%;
    width:200%; height:200%;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 30% 50%, rgba(233,69,96,0.08) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 70% 50%, rgba(83,82,237,0.08) 0%, transparent 50%);
    animation:pulse 8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{transform:scale(1)} 50%{transform:scale(1.05)} }
  .cover-content { position:relative; z-index:1; }
  .cover-badge {
    display:inline-block; background:var(--accent); color:#fff;
    padding:8px 24px; border-radius:30px;
    font-size:14px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:3px; text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:30px;
  }
  .cover h1 {
    font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem);
    font-weight:900; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff 30%,var(--accent) 70%);
    -webkit-background-clip:text; -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
    background-clip:text; line-height:1.1; margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .cover-subtitle { font-size:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,2rem); font-weight:300; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-bottom:20px; letter-spacing:2px; }
  .cover-details { color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-size:14px; margin-top:40px; }
  .cover-details span { display:inline-block; margin:0 15px; }
  .page { max-width:860px; margin:0 auto; padding:40px 24px 80px; }
  .chapter { margin-top:60px; margin-bottom:30px; border-top:2px solid var(--accent); padding-top:24px; }
  .chapter-number { font-size:13px; color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; letter-spacing:4px; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .chapter h2 { font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size:2rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--text-light); margin-bottom:10px; }
  .chapter p { color:var(--text-dim); max-width:600px; font-size:15px; }
  h3 { font-size:1.4rem; color:var(--text-light); margin-top:32px; margin-bottom:12px; font-weight:700; }
  h4 { font-size:1.05rem; color:var(--accent); margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:8px; font-weight:600; }
  p { margin-bottom:14px; color:var(--text-body); }
  table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:20px 0; font-size:14px; background:var(--bg-card); border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; }
  thead { background:var(--accent); }
  thead th { padding:12px 14px; text-align:left; font-weight:700; color:#fff; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.3px; }
  tbody td { padding:10px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--text-body); }
  tbody tr:hover { background:var(--bg-hover); }
  tbody tr:last-child td { border:none; }
  .day-card { background:var(--bg-card); border-radius:16px; padding:24px; margin:24px 0; border:1px solid var(--border); }
  .day-header { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:16px; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; }
  .day-header h3 { margin:0; font-size:1.2rem; }
  .day-badge { background:var(--accent2); color:#0f0c29; padding:4px 14px; border-radius:20px; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; }
  .img-container { margin:24px 0; text-align:center; }
  .img-container img { max-width:100%; border-radius:12px; box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
  .img-row { display:flex; gap:16px; margin:24px 0; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .img-card { flex:1; min-width:120px; background:var(--bg-card); border-radius:12px; padding:16px; text-align:center; border:1px solid var(--border); }
  .img-card .label { font-weight:600; color:var(--accent); font-size:13px; margin-top:6px; }
  .img-card .desc { font-size:12px; color:var(--text-dim); margin-top:2px; }
  .stat-row { display:flex; gap:16px; margin:24px 0; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .stat-box { flex:1; min-width:120px; background:var(--bg-card); border-radius:12px; padding:20px 14px; text-align:center; border:1px solid var(--border); }
  .stat-box .num { font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:800; color:var(--accent); }
  .stat-box .lbl { font-size:12px; color:var(--text-dim); margin-top:4px; }
  .quote-box { background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg-card),var(--bg-hover)); border-left:4px solid var(--accent); padding:20px; border-radius:0 12px 12px 0; margin:20px 0; }
  .quote-box p { margin:0; font-style:italic; color:var(--text); }
  .quote-box .attribution { margin-top:8px; font-size:12px; color:var(--text-dim); font-style:normal; }
  .prog-chain { display:flex; gap:4px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin:8px 0 16px; }
  .prog-step { background:var(--bg-hover); border:1px solid var(--border-light); padding:4px 12px; border-radius:16px; font-size:11px; color:var(--text-dim); }
  .prog-step.active { border-color:var(--accent); color:var(--accent); }
  .divider { text-align:center; margin:40px 0; color:var(--text-dim); font-size:20px; letter-spacing:6px; }
  ul, ol { margin:12px 0 12px 20px; }
  li { margin-bottom:6px; color:var(--text-body); font-size:14px; }
  .checklist { list-style:none; margin-left:0; }
  .checklist li::before { content:"✓ "; color:var(--accent2); font-weight:700; }
  .crosslist { list-style:none; margin-left:0; }
  .crosslist li::before { content:"✗ "; color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; }
  .track-card { background:var(--bg-card); border-radius:16px; padding:24px; border:1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom:20px; }
  .track-card h3 { font-size:1.1rem; margin:0 0 16px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
  .input-row { display:flex; gap:12px; margin-bottom:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:end; }
  .input-group { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:4px; }
  .input-group label { font-size:12px; color:var(--text-muted); font-weight:600; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.5px; }
  .input-group input, .input-group select {
    background:var(--bg-hover); border:1px solid var(--border-light);
    color:var(--text); padding:8px 12px; border-radius:8px;
    font-size:14px; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; min-width:80px;
  }
  .input-group input:focus, .input-group select:focus { outline:none; border-color:var(--accent); }
  .btn {
    padding:8px 20px; border:none; border-radius:8px;
    font-size:13px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer;
    transition:all .2s; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
  }
  .btn-primary { background:var(--accent); color:#fff; }
  .btn-primary:hover { background:#d63851; }
  .btn-secondary { background:var(--bg-hover); color:var(--accent); border:1px solid var(--border-light); }
  .btn-secondary:hover { background:var(--bg-card); }
  .btn-success { background:var(--accent2); color:#0f0c29; }
  .btn-success:hover { background:#3dbb92; }
  .btn-danger { background:transparent; color:var(--accent); border:1px solid var(--accent); }
  .btn-danger:hover { background:rgba(233,69,96,0.1); }
  .btn-sm { padding:4px 12px; font-size:12px; }
  .history-table td, .history-table th { padding:8px 10px; }
  .history-table .del-btn { background:none; border:none; color:var(--accent); cursor:pointer; font-size:16px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px; }
  .history-table .del-btn:hover { background:rgba(233,69,96,0.15); }
  .exercise-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto; gap:4px 12px; padding:10px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); }
  .exercise-row:last-child { border:none; }
  .exercise-row .ex-name { grid-column:1; font-weight:600; font-size:14px; }
  .exercise-row .ex-target { grid-column:2; font-size:12px; color:var(--text-dim); text-align:right; white-space:nowrap; }
  .exercise-row .prog-chain { grid-column:1/-1; margin:2px 0 0; cursor:default; }
  .exercise-row .prog-chain .prog-step { cursor:pointer; transition:all .15s; }
  .exercise-row .prog-chain .prog-step:hover { border-color:var(--accent); background:rgba(78,204,163,0.08); }
  .exercise-row .prog-chain .prog-step.done { border-color:var(--accent2); color:var(--accent2); background:rgba(78,204,163,0.06); }
  .set-group { grid-column:1/-1; display:flex; gap:6px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .set-group { display:flex; gap:6px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .set-check { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px; background:var(--bg-hover); padding:4px 10px 4px 6px; border-radius:6px; border:1px solid var(--border-light); cursor:pointer; transition:all .2s; font-size:12px; color:var(--text-dim); }
  .set-check.done { border-color:var(--accent2); background:rgba(78,204,163,0.1); color:var(--accent2); }
  .set-check input[type="checkbox"] { display:none; }
  .set-check .box { width:16px; height:16px; border-radius:4px; border:2px solid #555; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:10px; transition:all .2s; flex-shrink:0; }
  .set-check.done .box { background:var(--accent2); border-color:var(--accent2); }
  .set-check.done .box::after { content:"✓"; color:#0f0c29; font-weight:700; }
  .rep-input { width:42px; padding:3px 4px; border:1px solid var(--border-light); border-radius:4px; background:var(--bg-hover); color:var(--text); font-size:11px; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; text-align:center; }
  .rep-input:focus { outline:none; border-color:var(--accent); }
  .rep-label { font-size:10px; color:var(--text-dim); margin-right:2px; }
  .custom-rest-input { width:70px; padding:4px 6px; border:1px solid var(--border-light); border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-hover); color:var(--text); font-size:13px; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; text-align:center; }
  .custom-rest-input:focus { outline:none; border-color:var(--accent); }
  .rest-timer { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:13px; color:var(--text-muted); }
  .rest-timer .time { font-weight:700; color:var(--accent); min-width:36px; }
  .rest-timer button { background:none; border:1px solid var(--border-light); color:var(--text-muted); padding:2px 10px; border-radius:4px; cursor:pointer; font-size:11px; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; }
  .rest-timer button:hover { border-color:var(--accent); color:var(--accent); }
  .rest-timer.running .time { color:var(--accent2); }
  .progress-bar-wrap { background:var(--bg-hover); border-radius:10px; height:8px; overflow:hidden; margin:12px 0; }
  .progress-bar-fill { height:100%; background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent2),var(--accent)); border-radius:10px; transition:width .5s; width:0%; }
  .progress-stats { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:12px; color:var(--text-muted); }
  .week-selector { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:16px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .week-selector button { background:none; border:1px solid var(--border-light); color:var(--text-muted); padding:4px 12px; border-radius:6px; cursor:pointer; font-size:16px; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; }
  .week-selector button:hover { border-color:var(--accent); color:var(--accent); }
  .week-selector button.active { border-color:var(--accent); color:var(--accent); background:rgba(233,69,96,0.1); }
  .dash-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr)); gap:12px; margin:16px 0; }
  .dash-stat { background:var(--bg-card); border-radius:12px; padding:16px; text-align:center; border:1px solid var(--border); }
  .dash-stat .val { font-size:1.6rem; font-weight:800; color:var(--accent); }
  .dash-stat .lbl { font-size:11px; color:var(--text-dim); margin-top:2px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.5px; }
  .quote-card { background:var(--bg-card); border-radius:16px; padding:20px 24px; border:1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom:20px; text-align:center; position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
  .quote-card::before { content:'"'; position:absolute; top:-10px; left:12px; font-size:80px; color:var(--accent); opacity:0.1; font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; line-height:1; }
  .quote-card .qt { font-style:italic; font-size:1rem; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:6px; font-weight:400; }
  .quote-card .qa { font-size:12px; color:var(--text-dim); font-weight:600; }
  .chart-box { width:100%; overflow-x:auto; margin:16px 0; }
  .chart-box svg { min-width:400px; width:100%; height:auto; }
  .legend { display:flex; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin:8px 0; font-size:12px; }
  .legend span { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; }
  .legend .dot { width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; display:inline-block; }
  .cal-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr); gap:4px; margin:12px 0; text-align:center; }
  .cal-grid .ch { font-size:11px; color:var(--text-dim); font-weight:700; padding:4px; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .cal-grid .cd { aspect-ratio:1; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:13px; border-radius:8px; background:var(--bg-hover); color:var(--text-muted); position:relative; }
  .cal-grid .cd.other { opacity:0.2; }
  .cal-grid .cd.today { border:2px solid var(--accent); font-weight:700; color:var(--text-light); }
  .cal-grid .cd.has-workout::after { content:''; position:absolute; bottom:3px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); width:5px; height:5px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--accent2); }
  .cal-nav { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:8px; }
  .cal-nav .label { font-weight:700; font-size:14px; color:var(--text-light); }
  .cal-nav button { background:none; border:1px solid var(--border-light); color:var(--text-muted); padding:2px 10px; border-radius:6px; cursor:pointer; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; font-size:14px; }
  .cal-nav button:hover { border-color:var(--accent); color:var(--accent); }
  .meas-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(80px,1fr)); gap:8px; }
  .meas-box { background:var(--bg-hover); border-radius:8px; padding:10px; text-align:center; border:1px solid var(--border-light); }
  .meas-box .ml { font-size:10px; color:var(--text-dim); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.5px; }
  .meas-box .mv { font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--accent); }
  @media(max-width:600px) {
    .navbar { padding:0 10px; }
    .nav-links a { padding:6px 10px; font-size:11px; }
    .page { padding:20px 12px 60px; }
    .input-row { flex-direction:column; }
    .input-group input { min-width:100%; }
    table { font-size:12px; }
    thead th, tbody td { padding:6px 8px; }
    .exercise-row .ex-name { min-width:100px; font-size:13px; }
    .day-card { padding:16px; }
    .cal-grid .cd { font-size:11px; }
    .meas-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
  }
  @media print {
    body { background:#fff; color:#222; font-size:11px; }
    .navbar { display:none; }
    .page-content#page-book { display:block !important; }
    .page-content#page-log, .page-content#page-tracker { display:none !important; }
    .day-card,.stat-box,.img-card,.quote-box,.track-card,table { background:#f5f5f5 !important; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact; }
    thead { background:#e94560 !important; }
    td,p,li { color:#333 !important; }
    h2,h3,h4 { color:#111 !important; }
    .chapter p, .stat-box .lbl { color:#666 !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="navbar">
  <div class="brand">ICB</div>
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;">
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a class="active" data-page="book">Book</a>
      <a data-page="log">Log</a>
      <a data-page="tracker">Progress</a>
    </div>
    <button class="theme-btn" id="themeBtn">&#x1F319;</button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PAGE: BOOK -->
<div id="page-book" class="page-content active">
<div class="cover">
  <div class="cover-content">
    <div class="cover-badge">Science-Backed Edition</div>
    <h1>CALISTHENICS<br>BIBLE</h1>
    <div class="cover-subtitle">Strength &amp; Muscle &middot; No Weights &middot; No Chemicals</div>
    <div style="margin:30px 0">
      <svg width="70" height="70" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" style="opacity:0.6">
        <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="45" stroke="#e94560" stroke-width="3" fill="none"/>
        <path d="M35 65 L50 40 L65 65" stroke="#e94560" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        <circle cx="50" cy="35" r="6" fill="#e94560" opacity="0.8"/>
        <line x1="50" y1="41" x2="50" y2="55" stroke="#e94560" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="40" y1="65" x2="30" y2="80" stroke="#e94560" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="60" y1="65" x2="70" y2="80" stroke="#e94560" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="cover-details">
      <span id="coverName">Ismail</span>
      <span>Mon &middot; Wed &middot; Fri</span>
      <span>No BS Exercises</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="page">
<div class="chapter"><div class="chapter-number">Contents</div><h2>What's Inside</h2></div>
<table><tbody>
  <tr><td style="width:40px;color:#e94560;font-weight:700;">1</td><td>The Science &mdash; Why Calisthenics Works</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="color:#e94560;font-weight:700;">2</td><td>The 3-Day Program &mdash; Mon / Wed / Fri</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="color:#e94560;font-weight:700;">3</td><td>Exercise Library &mdash; Every Movement Explained</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="color:#e94560;font-weight:700;">4</td><td>Warm-Up &amp; Mobility</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="color:#e94560;font-weight:700;">5</td><td>Nutrition &mdash; Real Food Only</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="color:#e94560;font-weight:700;">6</td><td>Equipment &amp; Products</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="color:#e94560;font-weight:700;">7</td><td>YouTube Video Research</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="color:#e94560;font-weight:700;">8</td><td>Tracking &amp; Expectations</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<div class="divider">&loz; &loz; &loz;</div>

<div class="chapter"><div class="chapter-number">Chapter 1</div><h2>The Science</h2><p>Why Calisthenics Builds Real Muscle &mdash; Backed by Peer-Reviewed Research</p></div>
<div class="stat-row">
  <div class="stat-box"><div class="num">16.4%</div><div class="lbl">Push-Up Strength (8 weeks)</div></div>
  <div class="stat-box"><div class="num">39.2%</div><div class="lbl">Pull-Up Strength (8 weeks)</div></div>
  <div class="stat-box"><div class="num">95%</div><div class="lbl">Activation vs Bench Press</div></div>
  <div class="stat-box"><div class="num">=</div><div class="lbl">Equal Hypertrophy to Weights</div></div>
</div>
<h3>The Three Mechanisms</h3>
<div class="img-row">
  <div class="img-card"><svg width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none"><rect x="10" y="20" width="60" height="18" rx="4" stroke="#e94560" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none"/><rect x="10" y="44" width="60" height="18" rx="4" stroke="#4ecca3" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none"/><path d="M30 29 L50 29" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M40 24 L40 34" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><div class="label">Mechanical Tension</div><div class="desc">Train close to failure</div></div>
  <div class="img-card"><svg width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none"><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="24" stroke="#e94560" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none"/><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="14" stroke="#4ecca3" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="6" stroke="#e94560" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/></svg><div class="label">Metabolic Stress</div><div class="desc">8-15 reps, 60s rest</div></div>
  <div class="img-card"><svg width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none"><path d="M20 30 Q40 36 60 30" stroke="#e94560" stroke-width="3" fill="none"/><path d="M20 42 Q40 38 60 42" stroke="#4ecca3" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/><circle cx="42" cy="38" r="3" fill="#e94560"/></svg><div class="label">Muscle Damage</div><div class="desc">Controlled eccentrics</div></div>
</div>
<h4>Key Studies</h4>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Schoenfeld et al. (2017)</strong> &mdash; Bodyweight = equal hypertrophy to weights when intensity matched</li>
  <li><strong>J. Exercise Science &amp; Fitness (2017)</strong> &mdash; 16.4% push-up, 39.2% pull-up strength in 8 weeks</li>
  <li><strong>Youdas et al. (2010)</strong> &mdash; Push-ups = 95% activation vs bench press, superior triceps</li>
  <li><strong>Refalo et al. (2022)</strong> &mdash; Proximity to failure drives growth, not load used</li>
</ul>
<h4>The Rep Range Rule</h4>
<table><thead><tr><th>Goal</th><th>Reps</th><th>Sets</th><th>Rest</th><th>Tempo</th></tr></thead><tbody>
  <tr><td>Strength</td><td>3-5</td><td>4-5</td><td>2-3 min</td><td>Explosive up, controlled down</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Hypertrophy</td><td>8-12</td><td>3-4</td><td>60-90s</td><td>2s down, 1s pause, 2s up</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Endurance</td><td>15+</td><td>2-3</td><td>30-60s</td><td>Continuous</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<div class="divider">&loz; &loz; &loz;</div>

<div class="chapter"><div class="chapter-number">Chapter 2</div><h2>The 3-Day Program</h2><p>Full Body &middot; Monday &middot; Wednesday &middot; Friday</p></div>
<div class="quote-box">
  <p>&ldquo;For adolescents, perform whole-body strength training 3-4 days per week. Choose multi-joint movements using full range of motion.&rdquo;</p>
  <div class="attribution">&mdash; Texas Children&rsquo;s Hospital, Sports Medicine</div>
</div>
<p><strong>Tempo:</strong> 2s down / 1s pause / 2s up &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <strong>Rest:</strong> 90s between sets &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <strong>Rule:</strong> Stop 1-2 reps before form breaks</p>

<div class="day-card">
  <div class="day-header"><h3>Monday &mdash; Full Body A</h3><span class="day-badge">Day 1</span></div>
