<h4>How To Progress</h4>
<table><thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>When to Advance</th></tr></thead><tbody>
  <tr><td>Reps</td><td>Add 1 rep per set each week until you hit top of range</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Variation</td><td>Top of rep range 2 sessions in a row &rarr; harder variation</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Rest</td><td>Hit rep goal &rarr; reduce rest by 15s</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Tempo</td><td>Slow lowering to 3-4s for more time under tension</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<div class="divider">&loz; &loz; &loz;</div>

