</tbody></table>
<h3>Avoid These</h3>
<ul class="crosslist">
  <li>Protein powders (Cleveland Clinic warns for teens)</li>
  <li>Creatine (not studied in under-18s)</li>
  <li>Pre-workout (caffeine overload)</li>
  <li>Soda / energy drinks (chemical garbage)</li>
  <li>Artificial sweeteners</li>
  <li>Processed foods (5+ ingredients or can't pronounce = skip)</li>
</ul>
